@startuml
title UC-01 desktop web — Editor state and recovery

hide empty description

[*] --> Loading : open existing application
[*] --> Clean : open new application

Loading --> Clean : latest definition loaded
Loading --> Restored : tab-local draft restored
Loading --> LoadFailed : request failed
LoadFailed --> Loading : Try again

Clean --> Dirty : edit field or component
Restored --> Dirty : continue editing
Dirty --> Dirty : edit / copy or download draft JSON
Dirty --> ReviewWithProblems : Save [client validation fails]
Dirty --> Saving : Save [client validation passes]

ReviewWithProblems --> Dirty : correct a problem
ReviewWithProblems --> Saving : Save [valid]

Saving --> Clean : Save succeeded / clear local draft
Saving --> Dirty : Save failed / preserve draft
Saving --> Conflict : DRAFT_CONFLICT / preserve draft
Saving --> ReviewWithProblems : backend validation failed

Conflict --> Dirty : Copy or Download draft JSON
Conflict --> Loading : confirm Load latest

Dirty --> Clean : confirm Discard / new application
Dirty --> Loading : confirm Discard / existing application
Clean --> [*] : leave editor

note right of Conflict
  No automatic merge.
  Load latest is destructive only after
  explicit confirmation; recovery export
  does not change browser draft state.
end note

@enduml
